re are those who believe in Allāh and what was revealed to you and what was revealed to them, [being] humbly submissive to Allāh. They do not exchange the verses of Allāh for a small price. Those will have their reward with their Lord. Indeed, Allāh is swift in account.","j":4,"h":8,"s":3,"a":199,"sd":null},{"k":"3:200","t":"O you who have believed, persevere and endure and remain stationed and fear Allāh that you may be successful.","j":4,"h":8,"s":3,"a":200,"sd":null}],"juz":4,"hizb":8,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}